{
  "_comment": "Built-in official maker catalog profiles (adapter maker:<slug>, tier official_maker). Selectors were written against SYNTHETIC fixtures (testdata/maker-<slug>/README.md) and must be checked against saved real pages before a source is enabled. Override or add profiles with MAKER_PROFILES_FILE (same format, docs/MAKER_CATALOG.md).",
